<title>CANADA: Barrick, Bre-X propose Busang deal.</title>
<headline>Barrick, Bre-X propose Busang deal.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrick Gold Corp said on Monday that it and Bre-X Minerals Ltd had jointly submitted a proposal to the Indonesian government for the development of Bre-X's huge Busang gold discovery on the island of Borneo.</p>
<p>&quot;The Government of Indonesia is expected to advise Barrick and Bre-X of its response in due course,&quot; Barrick said in a statement.</p>
</text>
